{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28816","headline":"送从兄归隐蓝溪二首 一 · 许浑","name":"送从兄归隐蓝溪二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名高犹素衣，穷巷掩荆扉。\n渐老故人少，久贫豪客稀。\n塞云横劒望，山月抱琴归。\n几日蓝溪醉，藤花拂钓矶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28816.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28816","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}